# The miller, by his house on the square's east side. His cart's wheel is the second task: it came
# off on the way up from the stream, and he goes round the back with you to look for it (an errand:
# the conversation leaves, and the game brings it back when you are both there).

conversation miller in village
if wheel_found
  @ miller happy: She rolls like new. The benches will be out before the lanterns.
else
  @ miller worried: My cart's lost a wheel. It came off on the slope down by the stream.
  choice
  > I'll help you look.
    @ miller: Come round the back with me, then.
    errand WheelSpot
    @ miller: There! Caught on the waterwheel's step.
    play miller pick-up and wait
    @ miller happy: Not a scratch on it. I'll have it back on in no time.
    set wheel_found
    jump progress in square
  > Later, perhaps.
    @ miller: It'll keep. The stream won't, mind.
  end
end
